WEBVTT

00:00:29.145 --> 00:00:31.061
Možete li mi reći nešto o njima?"

00:00:31.593 --> 00:00:33.237
Uvijek upali

00:00:33.261 --> 00:00:35.957
i dobro se nasmijemo na račun toga.

00:00:36.164 --> 00:00:40.656
U stvarnosti je naš glavni grad, 
Ulaanbaatar, vrlo urban.

00:00:41.267 --> 00:00:42.681
Imamo komercijalne zgrade,

00:00:42.705 --> 00:00:43.877
brendirane hotele

00:00:43.901 --> 00:00:45.773
i predivna mjesta umjetnosti također.

00:00:46.078 --> 00:00:48.536
Ali prečesto

00:00:48.560 --> 00:00:52.352
se stranci fiksiraju na ono što 
Mongoliji nedostaje.

00:00:53.006 --> 00:00:55.853
Vide naš ogromni i netaknuti krajolik,

00:00:55.877 --> 00:00:58.195
tradicionalni nomadski način života

00:00:58.219 --> 00:01:00.987
i u tome vide znakove siromaštva.